  "question": {
    "text": "The equilibrium constant for the disproportionation reaction $2 \\mathrm{Cu}^{+}(\\mathrm{aq}) \\longrightarrow \\mathrm{Cu}(\\mathrm{s})+\\mathrm{Cu}^{2+}(\\mathrm{ag})$ at $25^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$\r\n\r\n$\\left(\\mathrm{E}^{\\circ} \\mathrm{Cu}^{+} / \\mathrm{Cu}=0.52 \\mathrm{~V}, \\mathrm{E}^{\\circ} \\mathrm{Cu}^{2+} / \\mathrm{Cu}=0.16 \\mathrm{~V}\\right)$ is",
